Ferrell) 21. Free and Open-Source Appropriate Technology (Joshua M. Pearce) 22. Education: By the People for the People (The Trapese Collective) 23. Social Movements and Global Governance (Marianne Maeckelbergh) 24. Horizons of Possibility: Challenge, Co-Optation and Transformation (Martin Parker, George Cheney, Valerie Fournier and Chris Land)},
